      "cooked": "<p><strong>Environment Twists</strong></p><p>It says to create the T-Rex with an environment pool... does that use the same scale as Unity? or is it the number of sides of the max or mid die?</p><p><strong>Scene 2</strong><br>When Haka loses patience, it says she attacks. No attack stats are given.<br><br>Should I be using a Villain profile, a Lieutenant die, or the Environment Pool?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
