      "created_at": "2018-07-03T12:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For the t-Rex you just create a d10 lieutenant, you always roll the environments die pool even if the environment twist you’re planning to use doesn’t use your roll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And for Haka, you can just grab dice at random or describe what she does, the rules do outright state that the players can’t beat her in combat.</p>",
