      "raw": "<p>For the t-Rex you just create a d10 lieutenant, you always roll the environments die pool even if the environment twist you&rsquo;re planning to use doesn&rsquo;t use your roll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And for Haka, you can just grab dice at random or describe what she does, the rules do outright state that the players can&rsquo;t beat her in combat.</p>",
