      "raw": "[quote=\"bluedarky\"]\n &nbsp; the rules do outright state that the players can&rsquo;t beat her in combat. \n\n[/quote]\nIt says nothing of the sort. It implies it weakly. It&nbsp;<u>adds</u> a hinder effect upon hitting her for damage...\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[quote=\"PW 67\"]\n Once she&nbsp;  actually starts fighting, any Attack the heroes land on her&nbsp;  that deals damage Hinders the next hero to attempt to&nbsp;  convince Haka of anything using that Attack&rsquo;s Min die.\n[/quote]\n \n\n That&#39;s pretty clear that damage can be done to her, otherwise, it never applies. \n",
