      "raw": "[quote=\"bluedarky\"]\n For the t-Rex you just create a d10 lieutenant, you always roll the environments die pool even if the environment twist you&rsquo;re planning to use doesn&rsquo;t use your roll.\n[/quote]\nI don&#39;t think that&#39;s true.&nbsp; I think it&#39;s a copy-paste error from the Pterodactyl Thief.&nbsp; Not every hazard involves rolling the environment&#39;s dice (see F5 #802, for instance). \n\nIt&#39;s definitely vague about Haka being invincible, but it does describe talking her down as the only path to success, and her clocking Tempest as the consequence of failure.&nbsp; The whole rest of the adventure assumes the heroes talked her down, though.\n",
