      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/aramis/{size}/1871_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-07-04T07:27:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>for my sunday group, I ran Haka as a d12 lieutenant - it was... unsatisfying for me and the players. She didn't feel tough enough. Further, since they burned their floaters to pacify her, and managed 3× (≥8) Overcomes... and one 13... they brought her along into scene 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Fortunately, the wednesday group is aiming for Russia first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit to add: descibing the d6 tyrranosaur (I used unity's table on the mid environment die) made for some good <em>comic relief</em>, too,</p>",
