      "created_at": "2018-07-05T11:03:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I ran Haka as an Obstacle, any punches just get her in a bad mood, no way to KO her, she will just go away if I feel like they punched her too much (hopefully after clocking Tempest into next year). I use a d12, d10, d10 and just went from there.&nbsp;</p>",
